# qi opens Quick Add on the INBOX project; Enter adds the task as its last child and names it.
file <<END
INBOX:
	- Old item
Work:
	- Email boss
END
keys qi
see Quick Add → INBOX
type Call mom
keys <Enter>
status Added to INBOX
quit
saved <<END
INBOX:
	- Old item
	- Call mom
Work:
	- Email boss
END
